  "title": "Babcock & Wilcox to Support TerraSpark’s Development Efforts for 1.6 GW Coal-fired Power Plant Project in West Virginia",
  "summary": "Babcock &amp; Wilcox today announced it is collaborating with TerraSpark in support of its planned energy generation project in West Virginia. The project, known as the TerraSpark Energy Campus, will include a 1.6-gigawatt coal-fired power plant, a multi-industry campus and a Coal Innovation &amp; Training Center for rare earth extraction and advanced materials initiatives.",
